## 1 · 🔒 WHICH RULES ARE LOCKS, AND WHICH ARE DISCIPLINE

> ## A declared limit is engineering. A hidden one is debt.

A rule backed by a `deny`/`ask` in `.claude/settings.json` is obeyed 100%. A rule that only lives
in this document is obeyed 40-60% — **measured in this project, not assumed.** Say which is which,
so nobody trusts a paragraph as if it were a lock.

| Rule | Enforced by | Level |
|---|---|---|
| ⬜ fill in as rules are added below | `deny` / `ask` / a validator / nothing | 🔒 lock · 🟡 prompt · 📖 discipline |

